      "description": {
        "fun": "Legend says Ninetales is nine noble saints reborn as one, and it can live for 1,000 years on the energy in its nine tails. It understands human speech and is famously vengeful: grab one of its tails and it may lay a curse on you that lasts a thousand years. It's based on the kitsune, the magical fox of Japanese folklore.",
        "guide": "The evolution of Vulpix with a Fire Stone, a graceful fox Pokémon with golden-white fur and nine long tails. It is intelligent, can live for 1,000 years and is said to curse those who mistreat it. Its Alolan form is an Ice and Fairy type revered as a deity on Alola's Mount Lanakila.",
